-- HavenCore: open-world level scaling (8.3.7, patch 8.2.5 level bands).
-- Open-world creatures scaled up to 100 (LevelScalingMax 100) instead of their zone's range.
-- Ranges come from the 8.3.7 client: the zone's UiMap LevelRangeMin/Max (the range the world
-- map shows, e.g. Elwynn 1-60, Westfall 10-60, Hellfire 58-80, Hyjal 80-90, Frostfire 90-100).
-- Zones whose map entry has no range fall back to the 8.2.5 band: Broken Isles 98-110,
-- Kul Tiras / Zandalar / Nazjatar 110-120. Only continent spawns, only difficulty-0 rows that
-- already scale; creatures spawned in zones with different ranges are skipped. Idempotent.

